---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BazaarPromo from '../components/BazaarPromo.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Volunteer | SMS PTO" description="Volunteer with the Sharon Middle School PTO and help make school events, enrichment, and community programs possible." current="volunteer">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="display-title">Why Volunteer?</h1>
      <p>Our PTO is strongest when many families contribute a little bit of time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div></div>
      <div class="volunteer-benefits">
        <p><strong>Make school events possible.</strong> Family nights, fundraisers, teacher appreciation, enrichment activities only happen because volunteers help out for a few hours.</p>
        <p><strong>Build community for you and your child.</strong> Volunteering helps you connect with other families, teachers, and the school. Kids love seeing their parents participate, even in small ways.</p>
        <p><strong>Support student learning — on your time.</strong> PTO efforts fund classroom supplies, enrichment programs, field trips, and more.</p>
        <div class="quick-links">
          <a href="#fundraising">Join a committee</a>
          <a href="#events">Volunteer or donate for an event</a>
          <a href="#grants">Help from home with planning or communications</a>
          <a href="#team-rep">Become a team rep</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BazaarPromo showVolunteer={true} />

  <section class="section section-cream" id="fundraising">
    <div class="container content split split-wide">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Volunteers needed</span><h2>Fundraising Committee</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p class="lead">The SMS PTO is seeking volunteers to help form and lead a Fundraising Committee. Our current fundraising levels fall significantly below those of comparable middle schools, limiting our ability to support key programming.</p>
        <p>This high-priority committee will play a critical role in strengthening financial support for SMS programs to build a sustainable fundraising platform for next academic year.</p>
        <p>Committee members will work collaboratively to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Develop a fundraising strategy for the new academic year</li>
          <li>Review benchmark fundraising models and best practices from comparable public middle schools</li>
          <li>Identify and cultivate opportunities for in-kind donations to support annual SMS needs and events</li>
          <li>Design and launch a signature SMS fundraising event that:
            <ul>
              <li>Raises approximately $30,000–$45,000</li>
              <li>Becomes an annual, sustainable event</li>
              <li>Does not compete with other fundraising efforts</li>
              <li>Strengthens parent community connections</li>
              <li>Is inclusive and offers tiered giving opportunities to ensure broad participation</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>Review and improve PTO fundraising infrastructure, including:
            <ul>
              <li>Enhancing tools to maximize donations</li>
              <li>Connecting with business that give a percentage of receipts to non-profits</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>Create a grant identification and application timeline</li>
          <li>Collaborate with SMS leadership and teachers to align fundraising and grant efforts with school priorities</li>
          <li>Build and maintain relationships with local businesses, community partners, and alumni interested in supporting SMS</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:SMSPTO@sharonschools.net?subject=Join%20the%20SMS%20PTO%20Fundraising%20Committee">Email Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="events">
    <div class="container content split split-wide">
      <h2>Volunteer or donate for an Event</h2>
      <div>
        <p class="lead">Our teachers do so much — let’s show them how much they mean to us! During Teacher Appreciation Week, the PTO is hosting daily events to celebrate them. Join us in saying thanks:</p>
        <div class="action-list">
          <a href="https://account.venmo.com/u/ptosharonmiddleschool">Donate to us to fund the week’s events</a>
          <a href="https://forms.gle/NtNdQGnkKvWuXb5RA">Have your child write a thank you to our amazing teachers</a>
          <a href="https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C084DADA92EAAF4CF8-63454102-sms2026#/">Volunteer to help out at one of the activities. Donate or bake a food item.</a>
          <a href="https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/BRTOXAL4F8KX/">Send in classroom supplies</a>
          <a href="mailto:smspto@sharonschools.net?subject=Teacher%20Appreciation%20Week%3A%20Donate%20a%20raffle%20prize">Email us to see how you can donate a raffle prize</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-burgundy">
    <div class="container opportunity-grid">
      <article id="grants">
        <h2>Help write a Grant</h2>
        <p>We’re exploring new ways to support our school community and would love to apply for grants — but we need someone with experience to guide us.</p>
        <p>If you have a background in grant writing or know someone who does, we’d really appreciate your help. Please comment below or send us a message if you’re interested in volunteering or connecting us with someone who might be a good fit.</p>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:SMSPTO@sharonschools.net?subject=Help%20write%20a%20grant">Email Us</a>
      </article>
      <article id="team-rep">
        <h2>Become a Team Rep</h2>
        <p>Volunteers serve as a resource for teachers on each team. This could look like organizing a supply drive throughout the year or reaching to the teachers before PTO meetings for any updates. We still need a parent rep for World Languages and for Specialists.</p>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:SMSPTO@sharonschools.net?subject=Team%20Rep%20Volunteer">Email Us</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .volunteer-benefits p { padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .quick-links { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .7rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .quick-links a { padding: .9rem; color: var(--burgundy); background: var(--cream); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .action-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .action-list a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--burgundy); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .action-list a:hover { color: #000; }
  .opportunity-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; }
  .opportunity-grid h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Calistoga', Georgia, serif; font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 400; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .quick-links, .opportunity-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .opportunity-grid { gap: 3.5rem; } }
</style>
